    <!--
      One of these sits beside 今天 on the Dashboard, chosen from the date so it holds still all day
      and changes tomorrow.

      Written to match the app's voice, which is 「一天挑一到两件就够」 — quiet and true rather than
      loud. No exclamation marks, nothing that congratulates you for opening an app. A line that
      shouts gets tiresome by the third morning, and this one is on the screen you open most.
      English is written for English, not translated from the Chinese.
    -->
    <string-array name="daily_mottos">
        <item>One thing at a time</item>
        <item>Slow is still forward</item>
        <item>A little today beats a lot tomorrow</item>
        <item>You don\'t have to win, just don\'t stop</item>
        <item>You\'re already on your way</item>
    </string-array>

